SUMMARY:Cultivated Cocktails w/ live music from The Brue
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\nHey y'all Come on out to Cultivated Coc
 ktails Distillery for some great live music by the band The Brue!\n\n# The
  BRUE Band — Asheville’s Groovy Rock Trio\n\n**The BRUE is a three‑p
 iece Asheville‑based band blending classic rock with pop\, blues\, and g
 roove\, known for high‑energy live shows and a strong local following**\
 n\n### Who They Are\n\nThe BRUE features:\n\n* **Karl Knutson** – bass a
 nd vocals\n* **Lou Collichio** – drums\n* **David Tarpley** – guitar\n
 \nTheir sound is described as a “classic rock crunch with a little pop\,
  a little blues\, and a lotta groove\,” delivering “pure good‑time e
 nergy”\n\n## Cultivated Cocktails\n\n### Not Just a Distillery. A Cultiv
 ated Experience.\n\nCultivated Cocktails is a family-owned craft distiller
 y\, cocktail tavern\, and kitchen rooted in the mountains of Western North
  Carolina. Founded by the Howard family in 2012\, Cultivated began with a 
 passion for distilling and a simple idea: create spirits worth sipping on 
 their own\, then build cocktails that show what those spirits can truly do
 .\nMost places serve cocktails\, we cultivate them.
